Task 1, you need to create a Bash shell script that displays the company welcome screen along with the current system information.

Step 1: Create the script
cd ~/Linux_Practices
touch task1.sh
nano task1.sh

Step 2: Write the following script in task1.sh
#!/bin/bash

echo "============================================"
echo ""
echo "        TechNova Solutions"
echo ""
echo "        Linux Server Setup"
echo ""
echo "============================================"
echo "Current Date : $(date +%d-%m-%Y)"
echo "Current Time : $(date +%H:%M:%S)"
echo "Hostname     : $(hostname)"
echo "Current User : $(whoami)"
echo "IP Address   : $(hostname -I | awk '{print $1}')"
echo "============================================"
